      <p begin="00:09.886" end="00:13.360" ttm:agent="v1">All my niggas countin' up the blue, I'm talkin' ''Hm-hm''</p>
      <p begin="00:13.360" end="00:16.190" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Hm-hm, ayy, hm-hm, yeah)</p>
      <p begin="00:16.190" end="00:19.110" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch, I'm 'bout my blue I feel like Nipsey</p>
