      <p begin="00:24.547" end="00:27.982" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Yeah, I thought I told you, I been stackin' bread like Jiffy (I thought I told you)</p>
      <p begin="00:27.982" end="00:30.887" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I thought I told you, I got power like I'm 50 (I thought I told you)</p>
